SCOPE
================================================================================

This license covers the contents of this repository: the MicroPython firmware,
the web panel, the documentation, and the described hardware design.

It does NOT cover third-party components used alongside it, which keep their own
licenses — MicroPython itself, the Raspberry Pi Pico W hardware and its SDK, and
any external tool referenced in the documentation.

NOTE: CC BY-NC 4.0 is NOT an OSI-approved open-source license, because it
restricts commercial use. That is intentional here. If you need an open-source
